Z||000001||Robert||02-17-2000||07:29 PM||||I lowered my 87GT 1 1/2" using the springs at carparts.com.<BR>Here is the URL: <A HREF="http://www.carparts.com/parts/search1.asp?OrderIdentifier=ID839631444912000201&reflink=42989-0-0-0&SegmentId=&parttypeid=3019&vehicleid=42989&catalogid=&partnum=NONE&dc=" TARGET=_blank>http: //www.carparts.com/parts/search1.asp?OrderIdentifier=ID839631444912000201&reflink=42989-0-0-0&SegmentId=&parttypeid=3019&vehicleid=42989&catalogid=&partnum=NONE&dc=</A> <P>If I lowered my car three inches, I'd never get out of my driveway.  Think about that before you put out money.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Robert (edited 02-17-2000).]||||reg||1
